@startuml
' ============================================================
' Wallet Module - Integration Sequence Diagram
' ============================================================

title Wallet Module - Integration Flow

actor User
participant "Wallet API" as WALLET
database "Wallet DB" as DB
participant "RECR Service" as RECR
participant "AUTH Service" as AUTH
participant "Payment Gateway" as PG
participant "LOG Service" as LOG

== Employer Pays for Job Posting ==

User -> WALLET: POST /wallet/pay { job_posting }
WALLET -> AUTH: Validate JWT
WALLET -> DB: Check balance
WALLET -> DB: Deduct funds
WALLET -> RECR: Job activated
RECR --> WALLET: OK
WALLET -> LOG: Log event
WALLET --> User: Payment success

== User Deposits Funds ==

User -> WALLET: POST /wallet/deposit
WALLET -> DB: Create pending transaction
WALLET -> PG: Initiate payment
PG --> WALLET: Payment URL
WALLET --> User: Redirect to PG
User -> PG: Complete payment
PG -> WALLET: Webhook callback
WALLET -> DB: Update balance
WALLET -> LOG: Log deposit
WALLET --> User: Balance updated

== User Withdraws Funds ==

User -> WALLET: POST /wallet/withdraw
WALLET -> DB: Create payout request
WALLET -> DB: Freeze amount
WALLET -> LOG: Log request
WALLET --> User: Pending approval

@enduml